    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995822",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-intro\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-intro { background: hsl(var(--background)); color: hsl(var(--foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro h1 { font-size: var(--text-h1); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro p { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .anchor-nav { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .anchor-nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding-inline: var(--space-4); border: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); color: hsl(var(--link)); text-decoration: none; font-weight: var(--weight-bold); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .anchor-nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .cta-links { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--space-6); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .cta-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: hsl(var(--link)); text-decoration: none; font-weight: var(--weight-bold); }\n.page-block-methodology-intro .cta-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<h1>How HealthHawk works</h1>\n<p>Real grades, real prices, and the claims that don't add up. Here's how we check — in plain words.</p>\n<nav class=\"anchor-nav\" aria-label=\"On this page\">\n<a href=\"#labels\">How we read the label</a>\n<a href=\"#grade\">How the grade works</a>\n<a href=\"#claims\">How claims are checked</a>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"cta-links\">\n<a href=\"/compare\">Try the compare tool →</a>\n<a href=\"/products\">Browse products →</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995823",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-labels\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-labels { background: hsl(var(--card)); color: hsl(var(--card-foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-labels .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-labels section { scroll-margin-top: 88px; }\n.page-block-methodology-labels h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-labels p { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<section id=\"labels\" aria-labelledby=\"labels-title\">\n<h2 id=\"labels-title\">How we read the label</h2>\n<p class=\"line\">We read the back of the pack: the nutrition panel and the ingredient list.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">We use the numbers per 100 g, as sold — not as prepared.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">Ingredients are listed by weight, so the first one matters most.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">If the label is missing or unclear, the product stays \"Not yet rated\". We never guess.</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995824",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-grade\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-grade { background: hsl(var(--background)); color: hsl(var(--foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade section { scroll-margin-top: 88px; }\n.page-block-methodology-grade h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade p { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .grade-ladder { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); margin: var(--space-4) 0; }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .grade-ladder .rung { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); min-width: 64px; }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); white-space: nowrap; }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .grade-ladder .hh-grade { min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade-letter { font-size: var(--text-h3); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade-a { background: #15803d; color: hsl(var(--card)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade-b { background: #65a30d; color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade-c { background: #ca8a04; color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade-d { background: #ea580c; color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .hh-grade-e { background: #dc2626; color: hsl(var(--card)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .rung-word { font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .example-box { background: hsl(var(--muted)); border: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: var(--space-4); margin-top: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .example-box h3 { font-size: var(--text-h3); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }\n.page-block-methodology-grade .example-box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<section id=\"grade\" aria-labelledby=\"grade-title\">\n<h2 id=\"grade-title\">How the grade works</h2>\n<p class=\"line\">Every product gets a grade from A (best) to E (worst), based on its nutrition panel.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">We use the same public scoring method as Europe's Nutri-Score label (2023 version).</p>\n<p class=\"line\">Grades compare products within the same category — cereals with cereals, not with milk.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">Drinks follow Singapore's own Nutri-Grade rules (A to D).</p>\n<div class=\"grade-ladder\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Grade ladder from A to E\">\n<div class=\"rung\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-a\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">A</span></span><span class=\"rung-word\">Best</span></div>\n<div class=\"rung\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-b\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">B</span></span><span class=\"rung-word\">Good</span></div>\n<div class=\"rung\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-c\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">C</span></span><span class=\"rung-word\">Okay</span></div>\n<div class=\"rung\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-d\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">D</span></span><span class=\"rung-word\">Poor</span></div>\n<div class=\"rung\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-e\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">E</span></span><span class=\"rung-word\">Worst</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"example-box\">\n<h3>Cornflakes vs Weet-Bix</h3>\n<p>Kellogg's Cornflakes gets a <span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-d\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">D</span></span>. Weet-Bix gets an <span class=\"hh-grade hh-grade-a\"><span class=\"hh-grade-letter\">A</span></span>.</p>\n<p>Same shelf, same algorithm: D vs A — the difference is in the panel, not the packaging.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995825",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-claims\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-claims { background: hsl(var(--card)); color: hsl(var(--card-foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-claims .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-claims section { scroll-margin-top: 88px; }\n.page-block-methodology-claims h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-claims p { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }\n.page-block-methodology-claims a { color: hsl(var(--link)); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<section id=\"claims\" aria-labelledby=\"claims-title\">\n<h2 id=\"claims-title\">How claims are checked</h2>\n<p class=\"line\">We check the promises on the front of the pack against the label on the back.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">The rules come from Singapore's official <a href=\"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/484/52300722-8fa4-41aa-a3b3-4bed2258b59c/a-guide-to-nutrition-labelling-for-food-products-(aug24)-(3).pdf\">guide to nutrition labelling</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">If a claim doesn't match the label, we show you both quotes side by side.</p>\n<p class=\"line\">If we can't check a claim, we say so. That's an open question — never an accusation.</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995826",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-faq\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-faq { background: hsl(var(--background)); color: hsl(var(--foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq p { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq details { margin-top: var(--space-3); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3); min-height: 44px; padding-block: var(--space-4); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.page-block-methodology-faq summary::after { content: \"+\"; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); transition: transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n.page-block-methodology-faq details > :not(summary) { padding-bottom: var(--space-4); animation: hh-fade-slide var(--duration-slow) var(--ease); }\n@keyframes hh-fade-slide { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(var(--space-2)); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\n<details>\n<summary>Is the Hawk Grade the official Nutri-Score?</summary>\n<p>No. Hawk Grade is our own chip. We compute it with the public Nutri-Score 2023 method (Santé publique France), but we don't use the official Nutri-Score mark.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Why are some products \"Not yet rated\"?</summary>\n<p>The label info we need is missing or unclear. We'd rather show an honest gap than make up a grade.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Does a good grade mean a food is healthy for my child?</summary>\n<p>Grades help you pick the better option on the same shelf. They compare products within a category — they're not a judgement of your whole diet.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Where do prices come from?</summary>\n<p>FairPrice, with the date we checked shown next to them. Prices change — always check in store.</p>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995827",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-sources\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-sources { background: hsl(var(--card)); color: hsl(var(--card-foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-sources .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-sources h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-sources ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-3) 0; }\n.page-block-methodology-sources li { font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: var(--leading-body); padding-left: var(--space-3); position: relative; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }\n.page-block-methodology-sources li::before { content: \"—\"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-sources a { color: hsl(var(--link)); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<h2>Sources &amp; licences</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FairPrice</strong> — prices, ingredients and nutrition panels, with the date we checked. Prices checked 2026-11-20. <a href=\"https://www.fairprice.com.sg\">fairprice.com.sg</a></li>\n<li><strong>Open Food Facts</strong> — contains information from Open Food Facts, licensed under ODbL 1.0. Pack photos are CC BY-SA 3.0, with credit and a link back; packaging may differ from local stock. <a href=\"https://world.openfoodfacts.org\">openfoodfacts.org</a></li>\n<li><strong>Nutri-Score</strong> — grades are computed with the Nutri-Score 2023 algorithm (Santé publique France). Hawk Grade is HealthHawk's own chip, not the official mark.</li>\n<li><strong>HPB</strong> — claim rules from <a href=\"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/484/52300722-8fa4-41aa-a3b3-4bed2258b59c/a-guide-to-nutrition-labelling-for-food-products-(aug24)-(3).pdf\">A Guide to Nutrition Labelling for Food Products (Singapore)</a>, revised Aug 2024. Drinks follow Singapore's <a href=\"https://www.hpb.gov.sg/healthy-living/food-and-beverage/nutri-grade/\">Nutri-Grade rules (HPB)</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b00eb1fb4d8630007995828",
    "html": "<div class=\"page-block-methodology-limitations\">\n<style>\n.page-block-methodology-limitations { background: hsl(var(--background)); color: hsl(var(--foreground)); padding-block: var(--section-y); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); }\n.page-block-methodology-limitations .container-narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--container-pad); }\n.page-block-methodology-limitations h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }\n.page-block-methodology-limitations ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-3) 0; }\n.page-block-methodology-limitations li { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--leading-body); padding-left: var(--space-3); position: relative; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }\n.page-block-methodology-limitations li::before { content: \"—\"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }\n.page-block-methodology-limitations .disclaimer { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); border-top: var(--border-width) solid hsl(var(--border)); padding-top: var(--space-4); margin-top: var(--space-6); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container-narrow\">\n<h2>Honest limitations</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Some products are \"Not yet rated\" because label info is missing. We never make up a grade.</li>\n<li>If two sources disagree, we show it on the product page — we don't hide it.</li>\n<li>Halal status comes from certification only — never guessed from ingredients.</li>\n<li>Grades compare within a category, not your whole diet. Not medical or dietary advice.</li>\n<li>Prices and recipes change. Always check the pack in store.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"disclaimer\">HealthHawk is independent and unaffiliated with retailers or brands. Grades are computed with the Nutri-Score 2023 algorithm — not an official Nutri-Score mark.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "containerWidth": "full",
    "blockName": null,
    "blockType": "rawHtml"
  }
]
